window.products.push({"id":1179013,"name":"CAMBRIDGE - AZUR 651A (BLACK)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t8jIZ+akL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"So we listened to you and instead of adopting the more common and simpler approach of including USB connectivity on a CD player, we’ve developed a direct USB audio connection to the 651A amplifier. So now, you can simply plug your Mac or PC directly into the 651A amplifier and with the addition of your chosen speakers, you’ll instantly enjoy a whole world of digital music stored or streamed from your computer. Computers are fast becoming a great addition to the hi-fi but they’re not without their faults. Poor quality soundcards plus jitter – a side effect of digital music stored on computer hard drives – means audio performance can be really lousy. But plug your PC into the 651A and you’ll be amazed just how incredible it sounds. Our in-house developed USB audio processor extracts audio data directly from your PC hard drive – bypassing its soundcard – and takes care of the critical digital to analogue conversion process bringing dull and lifeless MP3 files alive like you’ve never heard them before! Meanwhile, connection support for analogue sources like CD players, iPod docks and tuners is better than ever so whether you store or stream music from your computer, iPhone or maybe you prefer the luscious sound of good old vinyl, the all new Cambridge Audio 651 will make all your music sound amazing. Class-leading power of 75 Watts per channel remains another massive advantage and a whole host of custom designed components together with our legendary approach to design means whatever you’re listening to, it’ll simply sound fantastic. Adding to the audiophile specifications are separate transformer taps for left & right channels, twin rectifiers and separate PSUs for dual-mono operation of the left and right power amplifiers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t8jIZ+akL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cambridge Audio","source_asin":"B006IC50Q8","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179013","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006IC50Q8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B006IC50Q8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
