window.products.push({"id":1179015,"name":"Summit SK2-3.1X - 3.1MP - Digital USB 2.0 Microscope Camera - PC/MAC Compatible - Image Capture Software - Measuring Software (PC only) - C-Mount - 23","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eJugQPy6L._SL1000_.jpg","description":"The brand new OptixCam Summit K2 Series 3.1MP digital microscope camera is an ideal tool for brightfield microscopic standard applications in research, biological science, education and industry that often require capturing, documenting and analyzing color images at optimum visibility. The 3.1MP design is the most commonly recommended resolution class for microscopy at high and very high magnification. It is also well-suited to both PC and Mac operating systems with software designed to get you up and running with both live and still imaging. The camera is C-mount compatible and includes a 0.5X reducing lens for mounting on the 23mm smooth bore eyetube or trinocular port of most microscopes. Additional spacing collars are optionally available for 30mm and 30.5mm optical ports, along with a slide micrometer for accurate measurements. We highly recommend this camera for all general purpose applications such as industrial inspection, education and general microscopy use. The included K2View software provides for excellent color rendering and fast image processing especially when capturing multiple images. Simple, intuitive and easy-to-use controls offer image capture, notation, geometric measuring and storage in JPG, BMP, TIFF, RAW format. The software also includes auto white balance, color enhancement, anti-flicker and other benefits. TWAIN and DirectX plug-ins are also included on the installation CD and are independent of the main driver, allowing discreet control of the camera for these applications. Accessories include K2View Software CD, C-mount adapter with 23.2mm smooth bore and US2.0 cable. Camera dimensions: 58mm x 58mm x 32mm. Package Wt. 1.2 lb.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eJugQPy6L._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OptixCam","source_asin":"B00IOT1GIO","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179015","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IOT1GIO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IOT1GIO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
