window.products.push({"id":1179182,"name":"iKKEGOL 4-Port Monitor VGA SVGA USB 2.0 KVM Switch w/4 Cables Mouse Keyboard Video KVM Switch Kit","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n00pGL5kL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"This 4 port KVM Switch allows you to control four PCs from one USB keyboard and mouse! It is great for workstations, test benches or anywhere tasking between computers is needed.With support for 1920 x 1440 maximum resolution, this KVM is ready for any application.Portable and easily installed, switching between four computers is controlled by the push-button on top of the device. Description No external power needed (draws power from USB) Shares USB device such as USB Printer, USB Scanner, USB Flash Drive, USB Card Reader and etc High VGA Resolution 1024x768, 1920x1440, 2048x1536 4 Computer Ports: 7 Console Port: 4 to connect to computers + 3 console ports for keyboard, mouse, etc Computers Supported:  4 Keyboard Emulation: USB / PS/2  Mouse Emulation: USB / PS/2 Mouse Input / Output: USB VGA Input / Output: High Density D-Sub 15 pin LED indicators: 4 LED display for monitoring status. Size: 155 x 65 x 23 mm (6.1x2.6x0.9 inch)  Support Windows 3.x/98/ME/NT/2000/XP/Vista/Win7, Netware, Unix, Linux Notice: Avoiding moving the mouse or pressing the mouse buttons then switching the port. Notebook computer: Before powering on notebook computer, we recommend the user to connect the computer to emulation port (not link to console directly ) first and then boot it up. Trouble shooting The computer boot up fine, but keyboard doesn't word Make sure the keyboard works when directly plugged into the computer.  Try a different keyboard but use only 101 102 or 104-key keyboard. The Mouse is not detected during PC boot up.  Make sure the mouse works when directly plugged into the computer.  Make sure the mouse is a true USB mouse. Package Included: 1 x USB 4 Port Keyboard Video Monitor VGA KVM Switch Box 4 x 1.4 M VGA Cable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n00pGL5kL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iKKEGOL","source_asin":"B00JQAO9ZC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179182","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JQAO9ZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JQAO9ZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
