window.products.push({"id":1179261,"name":"CowboyStudio 600 Watt Photography and Video Studio Continuous Lighting Kit, 10 X 12ft Black Muslin Backdrop with Background Support System & Carry Cas","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QRRyDq-TL._AC_.jpg","description":"Daylight Balanced Bulbs: It is UL, CE listed and Energy Star. These high-output daylight balanced compact fluorescent bulbs are ideally suited for digital photography. They also have very low heat so they don't get hot like the more common photo bulb choices.  Light stand: Versatile, Hardworking & Lightweight; Black anodized aluminum; Stable & Quick Setup; Maximum Height: 1900 MM, 78 inches; Minimum Height: 810 MM, 32.4 inches; Maximum Load Capacity 2.5KG, 9.9 lbs; Closed Length: 805 MM, 32.2 inches; Footprint Diameter 925 MM, 37.8 inches; Mounting Stud 5/8 inches. Light Socket: The adapter swivels in all directions so you, or your stand, don't have to get the light where you need it even with difficult angles.  Soft Umbrella: Works well to diffuse the light from any flash creating a soft even light for your subject.  Muslin Backdrop: We have found muslin to be by far the most versatile material for photography backdrops. It is great for all types of photography: family, children, high school seniors, bridals, models, or even commercial work. 100% cotton to absorb the light and help eliminate reflection; completely Seamless; made from one piece of material; 3” rod pocket at one end; Machine washable; Allow for 5-8% manufacturing shrinkage.  Cross Bar for Background Support: This is a 3-section interlocked telescope cross bar for background support. Fully adjustable, extend from 5 ft 5\" to 10 ft with 5/8\" female sockets on both ends to lock on to any light stands. Holds canvas, muslin or paper.  Versatile, Hardworking & Lightweight; 3 Section lock; Black anodized aluminum; Stable & Quick Setup; Maximum Height: 2450 MM, 98 inches; Minimum Height: 788 MM, 31.5 inches; Maximum Load Capacity 19.9 lbs; Closed Length: 750 MM, 30 inches; Footprint Diameter 900 MM, 36 inches; Mounting Stud 5/8 inches.  Product code: newcb+Black13+S-600wkit(85w/5k)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QRRyDq-TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CowboyStudio","source_asin":"B00UWV7Z3W","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179261","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UWV7Z3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UWV7Z3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
