window.products.push({"id":1179413,"name":"RAM Mounts (RAM-273U) Base with 1/4\"-20 Hole Hex and 1.5\" Ball","category":"electronics","retail price":31.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ApvTD038L._AC_.jpg","description":"RAM stands for Round-A-Mount and was introduced in 1995. Far and away the most innovative product line of its kind, RAM continues to evolve into one of the most sought after accessories for electronics. RAM products have quickly become an essential mounting component for a wide variety of applications including rugged vehicle, industrial, military and defense, material handling as well as any application requiring a robust mounting solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ApvTD038L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAM MOUNTS","source_asin":"B003CMGZJI","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179413","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003CMGZJI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003CMGZJI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1179414,"name":"Shaggymax 16\" MacBook Pro Laptop Screen Protector Keyboard Cover Microfiber Cleaner Wipe 3-in-1 Aqua","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vHA4BZ5SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"16\" MacBook Pro Screen Protector | Keyboard Cover Liner | Microfiber Wipe Protect Clean Cover | Avoid screen imprints & damage from keyboard, cover the keyboard / trackpad area, clean your screen & chassis. This premium SumiTex microfiber screen protector boasts dynamic protection & superior cleaning properties, which will keep the MacBook Pro's chassis, screen & trackpad looking great. Exclusively tailored to fit the MacBook Pro 16-inch M2 / M1 / Intel 2019-2023 with 16\" Display. Sensible Insurance for your Mobile Workstation. Specifications Material: SumiTex Size: 13.875in x 9.25in (35.24cm x 23.49cm) Thickness: 0.6mm Made in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vHA4BZ5SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ShaggyMax","source_asin":"B0BP62LS4H","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179414","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP62LS4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP62LS4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1179415,"name":"Orion SpaceProbe II 76mm Altazimuth Reflector Telescope Kit","category":"electronics","retail price":124.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tOdhuj7-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This telescope and accessory bundle is ideal for backyard astronomers who are just starting to explore the wonders of the night sky. Not only does this inexpensive bundle include the complete Orion SpaceProbe II 76mm Reflector Telescope, it also comes with essential accessories for beginners. The petite SpaceProbe II 76mm Altazimuth Reflector Telescope is a great choice for anyone who is curious about space and the stars. The telescope's 3\" aperture (or diameter) gathers a good amount of light from the night sky for impressively bright and detailed views of celestial wonders. The whole family will want to join in the fun for great views of the Moon, bright planets, and star clusters seen through the SpaceProbe II 76mm Reflector. This is a complete reflector telescope setup that will help foster a lifetime of appreciation for science and astronomy. The SpaceProbe II 76mm Altazimuth Reflector Telescope is better than ever when used with the extra accessories in this value-packed kit. Use the Shorty 2x Barlow with the 25mm eyepiece that comes with the telescope to enjoy 56x magnification compared to 28x, and the combination of the 10mm eyepiece and Barlow bumps the magnification from 70x to a powerful 140x view for closer looks. Use the included MoonMap 260 to properly identify lunar features you see through the telescope. Read the included Orion Telescope Observer's Guide book to learn how to locate and observe over sixty interesting objects to explore in the telescope. Use the Star Target Planisphere to see what constellations and objects will be visible on any day of the year. The RedBeam Mini flashlight makes it easy to refer to charts and books while observing, and it helps you see small parts and knobs without disrupting dark-adapted vision.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tOdhuj7-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orion","source_asin":"B0732SD1SX","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179415","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0732SD1SX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0732SD1SX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
