window.products.push({"id":1179471,"name":"AboveTEK Tablet Pillow Holder for Bed, Hands Free 360° Swivel Phone/iPad Pillow Stand for Lap in Bed Laying Down with Soft Bean Bag, Fits 4.9 to 12.9 ","category":"electronics","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PpW-4--7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-functional & Versatile - The iPad pillow stand holder weighs only 2lbs, very convenient for you to use it anytime, anywhere. An ideal tablet pillow holder for lap on the bed, sofa, couch, chair, and ground, in a car or airplane. Hands-free iPad pillow for your home office, watching TV, studying, writing, working, and reading! Universal Compatibility - AboveTEK iPad lap pillow holder is adjustable to fit any tablet, smartphone, or eReader from 4.7\" to 12.9\". Compatible with iPad Pro 11 / 12.9 inch / iPad Air / Pro / mini 2 / 3 / 4 / 6, iPhone 6-iPhone13 pro max, Google Pixel / Nexus, eReader, fire HD 7 8, Samsung Galaxy, Tab, S10 / S9 / S8 / Note 10, Huawei P40 - P10 / MATE 30 / MATE 20, Kindle Fire HD 7 8 10. Adjustable & Flexible - 360° swivel rotation bracket, 180° bracket flip, and 180° foldable arm. Our tablet pillow holder elevates your screen to the perfect viewing height when you are sitting, lying down, or even reclining. The ultimate all-in-one bean bag tablet holder can free your hands from working, eating, zooming & binge-watching. No Sweaty Lap Pillow - Made of super stretch Lycra fabric and filled with EPS foam granules that are skin-friendly and ultra-soft. You can slides off the tablet lap pillow for washing, then zip right back onto the CoolFoam bead pack for cool, all-day comfort. No sweat - it is the ideal iPad lap stand for maximizing productivity. Ergonomic Design - The thick iPad pillow holder for lap in bed provides an optimal cushion for you to enjoy sports events. The anti-slide details allow you to use your tablet and phone at the same time. Simply put your phone/tablet on the PU leather panel, and the device guards will ensure the devices stay stable on the panel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PpW-4--7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AboveTEK","source_asin":"B08PYWYYSY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179471","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PYWYYSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PYWYYSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1179472,"name":"HP Pavilion W2081d 20 LED LCD Monitor - 16:9 - 5 ms","category":"electronics","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tAmGEDOPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With up to 1600 x 900 resolution and a 10,000,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio, this 20\" HP w2081d LED monitor showcases your favorite movies, games and Web content in crisp detail. Plug-and-play setup lets you enjoy quality images right away. -Ultrafast 5 ms response timeEnables pixels to change colors rapidly, preventing blurring, streaking and ghosting during intense action sequences in movies, games and more. 20 flat-panel LED monitorProvides a large viewing area and can be mounted on a wall for flexible placement options. VESA compliant. -10,000,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio (600:1 typical)Produces a multitude of shades between black and white that support precise color reproduction for vibrant hues. -200 cd/m² brightnessOffers a highly visible display and sharp on-screen images. -1600 x 900 maximum resolution at 60HzDelivers clear, detailed visuals. -DVI-D with HDCP and VGA inputsFor simple connectivity. -On-screen display controlsLet you easily adjust brightness, contrast, color temperature and more. Ten programmable modes allow customized use. -Slim designOffers a sleek profile. -Compatible with PCFor use at home or in the office. Plug-and-play setup lets you get started right away. Key specs-Response Time Response TimeThe speed at which pixels can change colors is called response time. It is measured in milliseconds (ms).5 milliseconds-Touch Screen : No-Screen Size : 20 inches-Input(s) : VGA-Refresh Rate : 60Hz-Maximum Resolution : 1600 x 900-Resolution (Native) : 1600 x 900 Warranty-Parts : 1 year limited-Labor : 1 year limited General-Color Category : Silver-Computer Compatibility : Windows Certifications & Listings-ENERGY STAR Certified ENERGY STAR CertifiedDevices carrying the Energy Star service mark, such as computer products and peripherals, kitchen appliances, buildings and other products, generally use 20% to 30% less energy than required by federal standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tAmGEDOPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HP","source_asin":"B00W0CLQZO","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179472","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W0CLQZO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W0CLQZO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
