window.products.push({"id":1179510,"name":"3.5mm to RCA Cable, GearIT Pro Series 25 Feet Premium Gold Plated 3.5mm to RCA Audio Stereo Cable for Headphones, Home System, Car Stereo, iPods, iPho","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KyQqzH+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3.5MM RCA SUBWOOFER CABLE - Use the GearIT 3.5mm to 2x RCA stereo audio cable to connect an iPhone/iPad, MP3 player, smartphone or laptop with the common 3.5mm aux audio port to a TV, AV receiver, amplifier, projector, radio or any other device with an RCA jack audio input (Red/White or the Left/Right RCA Port). METAL HOUSING AND BI-DIRECTIONAL CONNECTOR – This GearIT RCA subwoofer cable is equipped with premium metal housing to provide longer lasting durability versus other PVC connectors on the market. The RCA connectors have easy grips for plugging and unplugging while ensuring reliability. The Bi-Directional feature also seamlessly transmits stereo audio for high quality sound and is separated with common red and white male RCA plug colors. STEP DOWN CONNECTOR WITH 24K GOLD PLATED TERMINALS - This 3.5MM RCA stereo audio cable has the slim-line connector with beveled step down 3.5mm stereo audio cable allows the 3.5mm stereo jack to be easily plugged into your portable devices 3.5mm headphones audio jack without needing to take off the protective case on the phone or the tablet. The 24K gold contacts is for optimal signal transfer and corrosion resistance to provide you with best quality of sound. HIGHEST QUALITY MATERIAL AND TIER 1 MANUFACTURE PROCESS – Our product goes through many stages of testing to ensure it performs at the highest of standards. This cable is made of oxygen-free copper for supreme accuracy and sound quality and provides maximum conductivity and durability. The strain-relief rings near the connector makes the connector more stable and flexible. We use dual-shielding technology with high quality metal housing connectors to reduce signal loss for greater reliability. PRO SERIES LIFETIME GUARUNTEED – We stand behind the performance of all of our products and want to make sure each customer is satisfied with their purchase. If you are not happy with the product for any reason, we offer a simple return policy and exceptional customer service. All of our products are backed with our top rated lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KyQqzH+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GearIT","source_asin":"B01LZ4D2T5","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179510","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZ4D2T5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZ4D2T5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
