window.products.push({"id":1179576,"name":"8 Input 8 Output Video Wall 4K 60hz Controller 4x2 2x4 2x3 3x2 2x2 HDMI Matrix Switcher Processor HD Splicer Splitter Four Displays Multiple Inputs 1x","category":"electronics","retail price":2499.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GOHbmD5oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is one of the powerful and easy to use video wall processors in the market! You're not limited to only 1 media source... you can connect up to 8 media sources such as Apple TVs, PCs, Cable Boxes, Rokus, BluRay players, and more! You have the option of displaying any of your 8 media sources on any of the TVs or choosing any of the 8 media sources to display as one big video wall image across all 8 TVs. The resolution is the best you'll find on the market today....full 4K 60hz HDMI 2.0! Control is a breeze with pre-loaded presets, remote control, and PC software.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GOHbmD5oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"No Hassle Audio Video","source_asin":"B07YY8BT11","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179576","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YY8BT11","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YY8BT11","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
