window.products.push({"id":1179584,"name":"2 Slot Power Cord Two Pack - Includes Both Types: Polarized (Squared End) and Non-Polarized (Figure 8 End) - NEMA 1-15P to C7 C8 UL Listed - 18 AWG, 1","category":"electronics","retail price":13.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715MPUkaFxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get the Right Cord, Without Worrying About The Details Our 2-pack contains both a polarized and non-polarized power cord, so you don't have to worry about waiting a couple days to get it, only to have the wrong one. The Highest Quality Power Cords, Rated For The Toughest Jobs We use 18 AWG wire rated for 10 Amps so you don't have to worry about the safety and security of your devices. Our competitors often use lower quality wire that can short devices, or in the worst case, cause a fire hazard due to poor construction. Technical Specifications Power Outlet Type: 2 Slot NEMC 1-15p Power Outlet Type: 2 Slot NEMC 1-15p Device Connection: Figure of 8 (non-polarized) Square Figure of 8 (polarized) IEC 60320 C7 and C8 Device Connection: Figure of 8 (non-polarized) Square Figure of 8 (polarized) IEC 60320 C7 and C8 Wire Gauge: 18 AWG Wire Gauge: 18 AWG Amperage Rating: 10 Amps Amperage Rating: 10 Amps Voltage Rating: 125 Volts Voltage Rating: 125 Volts Wattage Rating: 1250 Watts Wattage Rating: 1250 Watts THE CIMPLE CO All of our high quality products are brought to you by our Family owned and operated company. All of our high quality products are brought to you by our Family owned and operated company. We are located in Utah, \"The Beehive State,\" here in America; where we have become a leading manufacturer and provider of high quality and durable electronic accessories along with OEM parts and replacements. We are located in Utah, \"The Beehive State,\" here in America; where we have become a leading manufacturer and provider of high quality and durable electronic accessories along with OEM parts and replacements. Our products are backed by our amazing warranty and a satisfaction guarantee, including 100% US based customer assistance. Our products are backed by our amazing warranty and a satisfaction guarantee, including 100% US based customer assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715MPUkaFxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE CIMPLE CO","source_asin":"B08MKY5LC6","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179584","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MKY5LC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MKY5LC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1179585,"name":"Adorama QpCard 101, 3 Cards with Black / Gray / White Colors used for the White Balance System of Digital Cameras.","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MQiDSmmbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"QP Card 101... The easiest, most cost-effective aid for balancing digital images. Even with correctly set and calibrated computers, software and monitors, you must balance a digital image against the monitor. A guaranteed neutral grey surface in the image simplifies balancing. It is complicated to carry around a cumbersome grey card and position it at a suitable place in the subject. In addition, the grey card becomes thumbed, dirty and faded from the light, so that after a while it is no longer neutral grey. QPcard solves these problems. QPcard is small, lightweight and inexpensive. The size of the card is 142mm x 40mm (About 5 1/2\" x 1 1/2\"). The Qpcard 101 is a strip of paper with white, gray and black colors. The pad of QPcards comes in a protective resealable foil bag that fits easily into a camera case or pocket. The cards have adhesive on the back so that they can be attached to virtually any surface. The grey surface is completely neutral and reflects 18% light. A white and black patch can be used for contrast adjustment. In addition, the card can be used as a dimensional reference. The paper is used to get a 'gray scale reading for reference when color balancing your monitor using photoshop. Qpcard is also a self-adhesive multi-function reference card for digital images shot by digital cameras or scanned from negatives or slides.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MQiDSmmbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QpCARD","source_asin":"B0002K6F66","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179585","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002K6F66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002K6F66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
