window.products.push({"id":1179593,"name":"Black Shark Bluetooth Earbuds with 2 Mics Call Noise Canceling, Wireless Earbuds with 24H Playtime for Sport and Work, One-Step Pairing & Smart Touch ","category":"electronics","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pFSmAXDSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Noise Canceling Microphones for Clear Calls: Each Bluetooth earbud has one built-in microphone with advanced background noise cancellation technology. Black Shark T14 wireless earbuds can effectively reduce background noise and neutralize environmental interference to allow callers to enjoy clear calls like face-to-face conversations, perfect for business or commuting. Ergonomic and Stylish Design: The T14 Bluetooth earbuds have a transparent black design that is high-tech, futuristic, simple, and unique, making it a favorite of both technology experts and game enthusiasts. In addition, T14 earbuds are also ergonomically designed to ensure comfort and stability enough. The earbuds only weigh 3.3 grams each, so even if these wireless earbuds wear for a long time, they will not result in any pain for our ears. One-step Pairing & Smart Touch Control: Turn on your Bluetooth device and pair it with the model \"Black Shark Lucifer T14\" after taking these wireless earbuds out of the charging case. After it is connected once, the wireless headphones will automatically connect to the last paired device. Unlike the traditional physical buttons, you can use single-touch control to easily skip tracks, change volume, play or pause music, activate the voice assistant, or answer/end/reject calls with the multi-functional button. 24 Hours of Use & Type-C Fast Charging: Black Shark Wireless Earbuds can last for up to 6 hours on a single charge and 24 hours of total playback time with a fully charged case. It takes only 1.5 hours to charge the charging case by USB-C fast charging technology. Also can be charged single side while one side used. Enjoy an all-day listening experience without worrying about batteries. Broad Compatibility & IPX5 Waterproof: In-Ear Wireless earbuds are broadly compatible with iOS/Android/Bluetooth-enabled system devices. IPX5 waterproof technology effectively protects the headphones from sweat and spills, making them an excellent choice for outdoor wearing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pFSmAXDSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Black Shark","source_asin":"B0B3MKYSFC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179593","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3MKYSFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3MKYSFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
