window.products.push({"id":1179716,"name":"Incipio Selvage Sleeve for 13-Inch MacBook Air - Blue (IM-349)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-nTfmI3PL._AC_.jpg","description":"Blending fashion and function, Incipio's Selvage Laptop Sleeve for MacBook Air 13\" brings a refined look to the laptop sleeve collection. Comprised of high-quality denim mixed with vinyl and soft tricot, the Selvage Denim sleeve defends against water and scratches. Unzip the Selvage Denim Sleeve to reveal a forest green lining with a black tricot. This vibrant combination of materials is both eye-catching and on-trend. The Selvage Denim laptop sleeve for MacBook Air 13\" features an exterior pocket stitched with aesthetics in mind. Safely store and maintain access to your tech and personal essentials! The Selvage Denim sleeve is embedded with luxe rose gold zippers and deep red edging to secure your MacBook Air 13\". The Selvage sleeve has a refined, trendy look while remaining functional. The interior of the Selvage Denim sleeve is lined with a soft inner lining to defend against scratches. Easily slide your MacBook Air 13\" in and out of the sleeve with ease for quick access. An authentic Incipio logo adorns the bottom right corner of the Selvage Denim sleeve. Keeping style and function in mind, the laptop sleeve is ideal for work or play. The sleeve exterior is crafted with high-quality denim material and transpires sophistication. This stylish sleeve for MacBook Air 13\" will ensure easy access to your device while remaining secure. Headquartered in Irvine, CA, Incipio has people in London, Hong Kong, and India, allowing them to reach their customers and work on projects 24/7. Their dedicated staff does just that. At 140 strong, Incipio's team includes some of the most talented industrial and graphic designers, mechanical engineers, customer satisfaction fanatics and software developers around, all led by a world-class management team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-nTfmI3PL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Incipio","source_asin":"B0088DJF84","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179716","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0088DJF84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0088DJF84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
