window.products.push({"id":1179809,"name":"Skinomi Light Wood Full Body Skin Compatible with ViewSonic G-Tablet (Full Coverage) TechSkin with Anti-Bubble Clear Film Screen Protector","category":"electronics","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YlFseaxYL._AC_.jpg","description":"The ViewSonic G-Tablet Light Wood Skin Protector is the clear choice for maximum scratch protection. The ViewSonic G-Tablet Light Wood Skin Protector goes beyond your traditional ViewSonic G-Tablet screen protectors, skins, covers, and cases. TechSkin is made from the same film material used to protect luxury cars, military aircrafts, and NASA space shuttles. The ViewSonic G-Tablet Light Wood Skin Protector is custom made to specifically fit the ViewSonic G-Tablet. Carry and protect your ViewSonic G-Tablet with style!ViewSonic G-Tablet Light Wood Skin Protector Features: • Dry application for Light Wood Skin • Includes Skinomi Screen Protector • Tough protective Light Wood textured skin • Virtually indestructible skin protector • Preserves your ViewSonic G-Tablet's original design • Protects your ViewSonic G-Tablet from scratches, dents, and physical wear-and-tear • Provides protection without affecting the functions of your ViewSonic G-Tablet • Non-sticky or restrictive outer surface Included: • ViewSonic G-Tablet Light Wood Skin Protector • ViewSonic G-Tablet Screen Protector • 1 Bottle of Application Solution (for screen protector) • Installation Instructions • Lifetime Warranty Compatible with:ViewSonic G-TabletThe ViewSonic G-Tablet Screen Protector features two layers of protection. The first, topmost layer contains no unsightly \"orange peel effect,\" while providing scratch-resistance and UV protection for anti-yellowing. The second layer is a thick, puncture resistant film to minimize damage from scrapes and dents. Unlike other ViewSonic G-Tablet screen protectors and skins, the TechSkin features \"self-healing\" technology, meaning scratches do not stay on the film, and keeps your ViewSonic G-Tablet looking new.For installation instructions and video please see: TechSkin Installation Instructions*Lifetime Warranty for this product is offered by the Skinomi.com, please contact Skinomi or review the FAQ section for more information regarding the warranty policy.WARNING: As with any electronic device, exposing it to excessive water or other fluids may cause harm to the device. Skinomi will not be responsible for any damage to the device caused by excessive water or improper application of the TechSkin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YlFseaxYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skinomi","source_asin":"B003F8QEXQ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179809","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003F8QEXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003F8QEXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
