window.products.push({"id":1179824,"name":"Motorola DECT 6.0 Enhanced Corded Base Phone with Cordless Handset and Digital Answering System L702C","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810ZlTeMpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description High Quality CORD/CORDLESS COMBO,DECT From the Manufacturer The Motorola L700C Series is a combination corded/cordless phone system that offers DECT 6.0 interference-free technology with the added advantage of a large 4-line LCD display. The L700C Series features an answering machine on the handset with 15 minutes of recording time, speakerphone, and a 30-entry phonebook for names and numbers. The L700C Series also includes an adjustable earpiece volume switch and customizable ringer with 10 selectable ringer tones. The handset speakerphone allows for hands free conversation for added convenience. Enjoy up to 12 hours of talk time and up to 180 hours of standby time from the handset's rechargeable NiMH batteries. Combination corded/cordless phone system that offers interference-free technology Corded and Cordless Handset The L700C includes a corded handset and base station in addition to a cordless handset. The corded base station has a full keypad for dialing, a 3-line amber backlit display, and will function when the AC powers down, so you'll still be able to make calls in the event of a power outage. LCD Display The 4-line LCD display on the cordless handset and the 3-line display on the corded base station feature an amber backlight for easy reading, day or night. It displays caller information including up to 30 previous caller ID entries, phone book entries, and more. Answering machine buttons are built into the handset Customizable color bands to suit your mood or the room's decor WiFi-Friendly DECT 6.0 Technology The L700C Series is wireless network friendly and ENERGY STAR compliant, so it won't interfere with your other wireless devices or home network. DECT 6.0 transmission gives you secure calls with virtually no interference. So you can add handsets with confidence that your wireless devices will continue to work optimally. Built-In 30-Entry Phonebook Store up to 30 names and numbers in the built-in phonebook. The quick access buttons let you find friends and family and dial them quickly. Handset Answering Machine With up to 15 minutes of recording time on the L700C Series' built-in answering machine, you'll never miss important caller information while you're out. Expandable to 5 Handsets The Motorola L700C Series phone includes 1 cordless handset with the L702C. You can add handsets to make it expandable up to a total of 5 cordless handsets, so you'll always have one near to take important calls no matter where you are in the house. It all functions from a single PSTN line, so you can add handsets to rooms that don't have a phone line jack. Customizable Color Bands Customize the look of your phone with customizable color bands. Available in a range of cool colors, you can match your handset to your room's decor or your mood. What's in the Box Motorola L700C Series with corded and cordless handsets and bases, power supply, telephone line cord, rechargeable NiMH batteries, user's guide. Which Motorola DECT 6.0 Enhanced Phone is Right for You? K301 L600 Series L700 Series L700C Series L800 Series L900 Series L510BT Series L512CBT DECT 6.0 Technology LCD Display Expandable up to 5 Handsets Digital Answering Machine Customizable Colors Wireless Headset Corded Handset Base Bluetooth","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810ZlTeMpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Motorola","source_asin":"B004NNUEYC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179824","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004NNUEYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B004NNUEYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
