window.products.push({"id":1179876,"name":"InvisibleShield for Skygolf Skycaddie SGX (Screen)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dg4ogA05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your search for a GPS case, skin, or cover is now over. ZAGG's invisibleSHIELD is an exceptionally clear and virtually indestructible film that will protect your GPS from unsightly scratches. Our exclusive, patented film-with nano-memory technology-covers and shields your device, keeping it as pristine as the day you took it out of the box. Maximum coverage protects protects the entire device; Full body coverage protects the front screen and back; Screen coverage protects just the front screen.The precision pre-cut invisibleSHIELD is designed for your specific GPS model. The invisibleSHIELD applies directly to your GPS, providing the toughest, most durable protection you will find. The invisibleSHIELD has its origins in the military, where it was used to protect high-speed helicopter blades from dust, dirt and debris. Now you can use that same powerful technology to protect your GPS.The invisibleSHIELD is only .2 millimeters thick; making it the slimmest GPS skin or cover of its kind. It is so tough that we back it with a lifetime guarantee. So, if it ever does wear or scratch, we will replace it for free, for the life of your device. And if you ever need to remove the invisibleSHIELD, no problem; it comes off clean and leaves no sticky residue.If you're still not convinced, check out our demo video and see for yourself how strong ZAGG's invisibleSHIELD really is.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dg4ogA05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAGG","source_asin":"B003V8ATQ8","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179876","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003V8ATQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003V8ATQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
