window.products.push({"id":1179912,"name":"KICKER 43DC122 Comp Dual 12\" Subwoofers In Vented Sub Box Enclosure, 2-Ohm Bundle with Rockville dB11 1400W Peak Mono 2-Ohm Car Amp and Bass Remote an","category":"electronics","retail price":369.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71du74u8tIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description of 43DC122: The 2016 Comp 12-Inch Dual Subwoofer Enclosure comes loaded with a single 2-Ohm terminal.With a stout custom box design and a pair of 12-inch KICKER Comp subs, this new enclosure doles out giant amounts of bass. Pair the box to a DX-Series Amplifier for the best combination of power and affordability. KICKER 2016 Comp Loaded Enclosures deliver a new look and flexible designs to work with any car or truck. The Comp 12-inch Loaded Enclosure works best with 300 watts of recommended power. Description of dB11: RockvilIe dB11 1400w/700w RMS Mono Class D 2-Ohm Amplifier Car Amp+Bass Remote Description of RWK81: The RockvilIe RWK81 8 AWG (American Wire Gauge) amp kit has the following diferences over other amp kits on the market at this price point. 1. Our RCA cables are 100 % copper. These are top of the line RCA cables 2. Better Resistance: The only thing that really matters with wires is the resistance rating. This is a measurement of conductivity and how much signal is loss per foot of wire. Since RockvilIe wires are made with around 3 times as much copper as any other wire at this price point, these wires had a much better resistance rating which means they will transfer more power to your amps than the other brands. 3. We do not cheat you on the thickness of the wire. These are standard American wire gauge thickness. This is another reason our conductivity is better than anything else at this price point. Other brands in the market place write 8 gauge, but cheat you on the thickness. We are honest about the thickness. 4. The RockvilIe amplifier installation kits feature a new soft abrasion proof insulating jacket. This rugged PVC outer jacket allows for 100% improved flexibility over standard power cables making them extremely easy to route through your vehicles interior, and it maintains exceptional resistance to grease and oil. The PVC outer jacket can with-stand an extreme temperature range of -40 to 220 degrees F.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71du74u8tIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kicker","source_asin":"B086DSSTG4","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179912","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086DSSTG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B086DSSTG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
