window.products.push({"id":1179939,"name":"Kordier Silicone Sleeve & Holder Grip with Writing and Protective Nibs Covers (2pcs) for Apple Pencil Accessories for iPad (2018), 9.7/12.9/10.5 inch ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21VcLDVBReL._AC_.jpg","description":"This pencil sleeve packaging included 4 pcs. modular design.  Its unique design of upper sleeve allows you easily remove the pencil's cap inside the sleeve while charging.  The benefit of Modular design is not only provide a Triangular or Bowling Grip for Apple pencil but also protective and writing nib covers to meet your different requirements. The protective nib cover design with extra bumper to protect the pencil tip for hassle-free carrying.  The Apple Pencil's nib is made of a hard plastic to screen that makes writing unnatural slippy, it sounds like a bird pecking at your screen.  The soft writing nib cover improves your writing experience with protection as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21VcLDVBReL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kordier","source_asin":"B07DCHG1CH","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179939","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DCHG1CH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DCHG1CH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1179940,"name":"Audio Pro Addon C5A Smart Speaker | Alexa Built-in, Smart Home Speaker | Multiroom, High Fidelity, Compact, Wireless Bluetooth Speaker | Also Good for","category":"electronics","retail price":249.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mwt95OJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AMAZON ALEXA BUILT-IN: The stylish alternative to basic Alexa speakers. Completely voice-controlled “Hey Alexa” speakers. Just sit back and tell the speaker what to play or control your living room lights. With Addon C5A, you have the benefit of a high-quality stylish speaker that has all the tech-forward advantages. WIRELESS MULTIROOM SPEAKER: A small and easy-to-place multi-room smart speaker. With stunning dynamics and deep bass in abundance, the Addon C5A home speakers perform bigger than it looks. Have a speaker in every room and play to one or all at the same time. Everybody can play their personal music on whichever speaker they want or get a surround sound feel in your home by having all speakers play in sync. WIFI PRESETS - PLAY DIRECT: No need to start fiddling with your phone, just push and play. Save your favorite radio station or playlist to a button simply by pressing it while playing content. With Airplay, Spotify Connect, and Bluetooth you can play all your music any way you like. There’s also the option for a 3.5 mm audio cable input. PLAY ANYTHING WIRELESSLY: The perfect addition to your smart home devices! Just connect your turntable or CD player to the C5A wireless speaker, and let the sound stream wirelessly to all the speakers in your setup. Old School is the New Cool. QUICK & EASY SETUP: Audio Pro App Connectivity! Easy to use! We know everybody says this but this app truly is. Simply connect it to your home Wifi network once and you're good to go. Add additional speakers over time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mwt95OJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Audio Pro","source_asin":"B071SF6ML3","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179940","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071SF6ML3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B071SF6ML3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1179941,"name":"Microsoft Surface Laptop Go Touch Intel i5 8GB 256GB SSD (Renewed)","category":"electronics","retail price":439.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rb5BI+WhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rb5BI+WhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B08SHQF55R","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179941","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SHQF55R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SHQF55R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
