window.products.push({"id":1179961,"name":"Samsung Gear IconX 2016 Cordfree Fitness Earbuds with Activity Tracker - Black - Discontinued by Manufacturer","category":"electronics","retail price":111.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PEIFiXiaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed with fitness in mind, the Gear icon by Samsung is the perfect workout partner for the Active listener. With Gear icon, you'll enjoy superior audio in a totally cable-free Package that includes stabilizing, Wing tipped ear gels, a super-lightweight design and a Compact, Convenient charging case. Users can stream music directly from their phone, or use the Built-in music player and not have to worry about carrying their phone to the gym or on those long walks or runs. 4GB of on board storage allows them to store up to 1000 songs directly on the headset for autonomous, phone-free listening. Add this to the built in activity tracker and Heart rate monitor and take your workout to the next level. Trouble Shooting Steps: With a case that doubles as a charger, you can power your Gear IconX while it’s resting and launch into those extensive workout sessions without missing a beat. Play your music library up to 3.4 – 3.8 hours or stream for 1.5 – 1.6 hours without charging. Rechargeable cases refuels battery twice between charges. Earbud: 47mAh rechargeable li-ion, charging case: 315 mAh . Control with a touch Tap and hold to hear voice prompts guide you through Gear IconX’s functions from playing music and talking or rejecting calls to turning on the ambient sound mode. When you hear the function you need, lift your finger to activate it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PEIFiXiaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B01H3EEOD4","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179961","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H3EEOD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H3EEOD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1179962,"name":"Bluetooth Headset Wireless Headset with Microphone Noise Canceling & Charging Stand, Superior Voice Pickup, AI-Enhanced Calls, Wireless Headphones wit","category":"electronics","retail price":59.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iAbTnHmML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【AI Noise Cancelling Headset】Built-in DSP,CVC8.0 and AI noise cancellation technology, eliminating up to 99% of the noise and echo on calls. The wireless headset with microphone allows you to enjoy a clear and unobstructed wireless mobile phone and the freedom of music while you drive, run or work. NOTE: NOT ACTIVE NOISE CANCELLING! 【Bluetooth Headset with USB Dongle】The wireless headset with USB dongle and can be connected to devices without Bluetooth capabilities. Just plug the USB port into your computer, turn on the computer headset, then pair up automatically. Qualcomm chip and Bluetooth 5.0 provides a more stable connection and compatible with cell phones, laptops, computers and other Bluetooth devices. Perfect for computer, call center, office, online class, Skype, Zoom, Google Conferences, etc. 【Wireless Headset with Microphone & Smart Mute】Rotating mic boom can auto toggle mute without clicking button. Rotated the mic boom upwards, the mute is automatically on. Rotated the mic boom down to your mouth, the mute will automatically off. The bluetooth headset with microphone frees you from frequent keystrokes and gives you the freedom to switch between calls and privacy. 270°Rotating mic support left or right ear. 【Long Battery Life】Wireless Headset with charging base that can be fully charged in 2 hours, and offers up to 20 hours of talk time and 7,200 hours of standby time. A plug-and-play offer you an effortless charging experience, ideal for audio calls where you can focus on the task at hand, without worry no power. Also adding stylish and elegant for your office. 【Comfortable and Mutifunctional Base Design】Soft and breathable earmuffs ensure a all-day-comfort wear experience. Adjustable headband fits into any head shape without slipping off your head, great for glasses wearers. The charging base with USB A interface can charge wireless headset for work and other USB A interface devices. The grooves are designed to hold small items such as u-disks and earplugs, enjoy your small storage box. 【Worry-free After-sales Service】Wireless Headset for computer has 3 years warranty, 24 hours customer services and professional technology teamservices.so please do not hesitate contacting us if there is any after-sale issue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iAbTnHmML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WYHOO","source_asin":"B0BZ4K5MXC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179962","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ4K5MXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ4K5MXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1179963,"name":"Spedal 4K Webcam with Ring Light, Built-in Privacy Cover and Dual Microphone, Fast AutoFocus, Adjustable Brightness, USB Streaming Web Camera with Tri","category":"electronics","retail price":71.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oNWBliSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【UHD 4K Webcam with Sony Sensor】This Spedal 4k webcam is built with a Sony CMOS sensor that features up to 3840x2160 UHD resolution at 30fps.7-layers glass lens makes the picture's quality clear and translucent. Offering you smoother video streaming on social media, the picture quality is clear and translucent. Note: Windows 7 supports a maximum resolution of 1080p/30fps and is not capable of 4K resolution. To enjoy this 4K 8MP webcam, please make sure your software and screen support 4K! 【Three Level Adjustable Ring Light】This stream webcam is built in 3 different colors LED and stepless adjustable brightness to deliver brighter and softer tone light without glare. Single press the touch button to change the color temperatures and brightness without the need to go into software settings. delivering different lighting requirements for your video chatting or streaming, making your video professional and beautiful even in darker environments. Compatible with Livestream software such as OBS. 【Webcam with Privacy Cover & Tripod】The built-in privacy cover and the remote disable video allow you to enjoy safe digital web life when not in use and prevent hackers from spying on you. It is perfect to provide privacy, security, and peace of mind to individuals, groups, companies, and governments. The USB webcam comes with a tripod, convenient for you to place the desktop webcam, and is easy to set up. 【Computer Webcam with Dual Mics & Auto Focus】4k web camera with built-in dual microphone, it is available to pick up your voice and filter out background noise automatically, enabling you to enjoy a clearer voice for hassle-free communication. Even in noisy surroundings, you can capture the sounds you want. Real-time autofocus makes you never have to worry about adjusting the focal length. It always automatically finds the optimal focal distance for your scene. 【USB A & C Webcam and Wide Compatibility】 The pc webcam works with USB-A or USB-C with included Adapter. Plug and play, No additional driver required. The computer webcam is compatible with Windows XP/7/8/10/11, Mac OS, Android V5.0, Linux, Chrome OS, Ubuntu, etc. Perfect for Zoom, Video Calling, Face time, Facebook, YouTube, Gaming, Streaming, Recording, Online School, and any other popular video calling software.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oNWBliSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spedal","source_asin":"B0BKZLG5NM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1179963","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZLG5NM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZLG5NM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
